comments.body:
I think it would be good to wrap up this project in a few pull requests and just focus on the important ones:

* Fixup the places that do a vin/vout `resize()` in combination with immediately following field-assignment: E.g. `tx.vout.resize(1); tx.vout[0].nValue=...`. Everything else is probably best left as-is style-wise for now to avoid code and review churn.


So I think the diff would be something like this: (unreviewed slop, need to drop the changes that are already in reviewed pulls, also should use multi-line initializer lists with trailing comma):

<details><summary>a diff</summary>

